meta-pynq-z1
============

Board layer for the PYNQ-Z1 (Zynq-7000, dual Cortex-A9) on AMD EDF 26.06
(Yocto scarthgap). The machine conf, multiconfig and device trees were
generated by gen-machine-conf from hardware/pynq-z1-ps-only.xsa.

sdt/zynq-pynq-z1-sdt/ holds the system device tree sources. The bitstream and
ps7_init files are not committed because they are already in the XSA; run
../scripts/extract-xsa.sh to copy them in before building.

See ../README.md for the full build.
